# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Scan output names real machines and real local accounts. Keep it out.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Reports/
#  Every report type (.html, .csv, .json, .records.json, .ckl, .cklb) and the
#  roll-up's pages and CSVs.
compliance-scan-*
compliance-rollup-*
#  Names used before v0.2.0.
cmmc-scan-*.csv
cmmc-scan-*.json
CmmcScan.local*.psd1
*.snapshot.json

#  Your own thresholds. Wildcards, so a copy ("ComplianceScan.local - Copy.psd1")
#  is covered too; the shipped example is a different name and stays tracked.
ComplianceScan.local*.psd1

#  Personal copies of instructions, such as CLAUDE.local.md.
*.local*.md

#  Power BI Desktop writes the data it loaded into the project's .pbi cache and
#  local paths into its settings. A .pbix holds data too, and a .pbit can hold
#  your report folder: the template goes on the Release, not in the repo.
**/.pbi/localSettings.json
**/.pbi/cache.abf
*.pbix
*.pbit

# ---- editor and OS scratch ----
*.bak
*.tmp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
